          "kind": "contract",
          "text": "ADR-0014 makes the ActiveGraph run authoritative for agent work state and demotes DOT to a compiled projection, staged in three phases: A mirrors events into the graph, B moves dispatch to a behavior reacting to `task.ready` and compiles DOT back out, C retires checkpoints and hand-authored pipeline DOT. ADR-0015 fixes the shape — `project` → `milestone` → `task`, tasks nesting recursively via `parent_of`, with `action`, `artifact` and `evaluation` attached only by `executes`/`generates`/`evaluates`/`discovered_from`. ADR-0016 constrains how Phase A lands: a new `EventEmitter` backend appended in `build_emitter()` behind `activegraph_enabled` and `activegraph_store`, with the JSONL schema untouched."
