          "text": "The rule these three establish is that agent work state is written only as ActiveGraph events, and that DOT and signal files are compiled projections rather than hand-edited sources. Its corollary on the events boundary: new consumers of the `PipelineEvent` stream are added as backends, never by altering the published JSONL — a real format change still owes its own ADR-0007 record."
